:''Not to be confused with [[Abyssal Stage]]s.''
'''The Great Abyss''' is the 24th stage in [[Into the Future]], and marks the halfway point in the chapter. Each chapter introduces a different enemy; [[I.M. Phace]] for Chapter 1, [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] for Chapter 2 and [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] for Chapter 3. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], clearing this stage unlocks the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] banner.

