==Trivia==
*The Great Abyss' base is a redesigned version of [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]]'s base from [[Kumanchu Royale]], the [[wikipedia:National Diet Building|National Diet Building]].
*All three bosses of The Great Abyss are [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] counterparts to the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] bosses of [[Empire of Cats]].
*The whirlpool that represents [[Immeasurable Power]] on [[Zero Legends]]' [[Media:Map042.png|rearranged North and South America map]] looks nearly identical to The Great Abyss.

